      "type": "p",
      "text": "YOUR DREAM. OUR PRIORITY."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "THAT'S LEGENDARY."
    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "Legendary Contractors The premier custom home builder in Lafayette Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "WHY CHOOSE US?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Known for our innovative concepts, meticulous attention to detail, and cost-effective approach, we aim to set the bar high for legendary living spaces. Both owners are native Southern Louisiana residents, and bring a deep-rooted passion to crafting homes that reflect the region's character and charm."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "​"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Legendary's homes have unique design layouts, crafted to the highest degree of workmanship and will be cherished for generations to come."
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "New Home Construction"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At Legendary Contractors, we are dedicated to building custom homes that reflect the unique character and charm of Southern Louisiana. Our team of experienced builders and designers work closely with clients to create living spaces that are both functional and beautiful. From initial concept to final walkthrough, we ensure that every detail is meticulously crafted to exceed your expectations."
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Home Renovations"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Transform your home into a legendary living space with Legendary Contractors. Our renovation services are tailored to your specific needs and preferences. Whether you are looking to update a single room or revamp your entire home, our team will work with you to create a space that you will love for years to come."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Take a look at the process behind each Legendary Project"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "are proud members of"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "View our Legendary Portfolio or contact us for a free consultation"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "About Us"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At Legendary Contractors, we specialize in turning your dream home into reality. As a premier homebuilder offering comprehensive design-build services, we simplify the process of creating custom spaces that reflect your unique vision and lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "With a seamless approach that combines architecture, design, and construction under one roof, our team works closely with you from concept to completion. Whether you’re building a new home, remodeling, or creating a one-of-a-kind space, we deliver innovative solutions, impeccable craftsmanship, and attention to every detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We are passionate about creating homes that are as functional as they are beautiful, blending timeless design with modern efficiency. With over a decade of combined experience and a reputation for excellence, we are committed to exceeding your expectations and ensuring your home is a true reflection of your personality and needs."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Your journey to a dream home starts here. Let’s build something extraordinary together."
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Meet the Builders"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Blake and Bobby, two southern Louisiana natives, shared a lifelong dream of entrepreneurship and a passion for construction. With Blake's background in engineering and a master's degree in business administration, paired with Bobby's expertise in land surveying, they formed a dynamic duo ready to take on the world of residential and commercial construction. Together, they founded their company, leveraging their complementary skill sets and shared vision to create a successful business that thrives on innovation, integrity, and a deep-rooted commitment to their community. With their combined expertise and unwavering dedication, Blake and Bobby have built not only structures but also lasting relationships, leaving an indelible mark on the landscape of southern Louisiana."
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Meet the Designers"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Heather and Nicole's journey began over a decade ago in the fast-paced world of healthcare. With each passing year, they discovered a shared passion for design and architecture, finding inspiration in the beauty of well-crafted spaces and the transformative power of thoughtful interiors. Fueled by their mutual love for creativity and innovation, they embarked on a new chapter together, channeling their combined expertise into a shared vision of creating homes that would inspire and uplift. Now, as co-owners of Inspire by Legendary, Heather and Nicole bring their unique blend of precision and design flair to every project they undertake. With a keen eye for detail and a commitment to excellence, they work tirelessly to turn their clients' dreams into reality, crafting residential homes that are as functional as they are breathtakingly beautiful. Together, they infuse each space with a sense of warmth, harmony, and timeless elegance, leaving a lasting legacy of inspired living in every home they touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Follow Us"
    },
